{% doc %}
  @prompt
    帮我生成一个Shopify OS2.0 自定义Section代码，功能是放在首页轮播Banner底部的通栏提示条，要求如下：
    1. 布局：100%全屏通栏，横向居中单行布局，固定悬浮在横幅图片最底部，不遮挡Banner主体画面；
    2. 后台自定义设置项（全部可视化可改，不用改代码）：
       - 背景颜色选择器：自定义通栏底色（示例棕色#887c70，支持任意色值修改）
       - 文字内容文本框：自定义显示文案，示例文本「SoftClub Members: Register & Earn Cozy Coins」，文本可选加粗，文本底下有下划线 
      - 文字颜色选择器：自定义文案字体颜色
       - 跳转链接输入框：填写后整行通栏可点击跳转指定页面链接，留空则不可点击
       - 内边距设置：上下padding数值输入，控制通栏高度
       - 文字字号设置：单独控制文案大小
       -手机端文案自动换行
    3. 样式规范：
       - 文字水平居中、垂直居中对齐，单行不换行；
       - 无圆角、无边框，全屏宽度铺满屏幕；
       - 适配移动端/桌面端，手机端文字自动微调字号，通栏保持全屏；
       - 点击链接hover轻微加深背景色交互效果；
    4. 文件输出格式：完整Section代码（包含{% schema %}后台配置 + liquid布局 + 内置css样式），代码分段清晰，注释标注每个自定义设置功能，可直接复制粘贴到Shopify主题新建section使用；
    5. 额外要求：代码兼容所有Shopify免费/付费主题，不依赖外部JS，纯liquid+css实现，无兼容性报错。
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-banner-strip-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .ai-banner-strip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  {% if block.settings.link != blank %}
    .ai-banner-strip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color | color_darken: 5 }};
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-banner-strip-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 1px;
  }

  .ai-banner-strip-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 20px;
    {% if block.settings.text_bold %}
      font-weight: 700;
    {% else %}
      font-weight: 400;
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.text_underline %}
      text-decoration: underline;
    {% else %}
      text-decoration: none;
    {% endif %}
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .ai-banner-strip-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-banner-strip-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.font_size | times: 0.85 | round }}px;
      white-space: normal;
      word-wrap: break-word;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<banner-strip-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-banner-strip-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.link != blank %}
    <a href="{{ block.settings.link }}" class="ai-banner-strip-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-banner-strip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-banner-strip-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <p class="ai-banner-strip-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% else %}
    <div class="ai-banner-strip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-banner-strip-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <p class="ai-banner-strip-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.text }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</banner-strip-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class BannerStrip{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }
    }
    customElements.define('banner-strip-{{ ai_gen_id }}', BannerStrip{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Banner strip",
  "tag": null,
  "class": "banner-strip-block",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "SoftClub Members: Register & Earn Cozy Coins"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link",
      "label": "Link"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Text style"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "font_size",
      "label": "Font size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 14
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "text_bold",
      "label": "Bold text",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "text_underline",
      "label": "Underline text",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Background"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#887c70"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 12
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Banner strip"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
